sequenceDiagram
    actor Reader
    participant Web as Web App
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Loan as Loan Service
    participant Catalog as Catalog Service
    participant Fine as Fine Service
    participant Notify as Notification Service
    participant DB as Database

    Reader->>Web: Request loan
    Web->>GW: POST /loans
    GW->>Loan: Forward request
    Loan->>Fine: Check pending fines
    Fine-->>Loan: No fines
    Loan->>Catalog: Check availability
    Catalog-->>Loan: Available
    Loan->>DB: Save loan
    Loan->>Catalog: Update book status
    Loan->>Notify: Send confirmation
    Notify-->>Reader: Email confirmation
    Loan-->>GW: Loan created
    GW-->>Web: 201 Created
    Web-->>Reader: Show confirmation
